Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Zekken shows up at 3 o'clock\Non this island on Floor 24. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll see you guys\Nthere tomorrow at 2:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it will! Ha, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Berserk Healer's gonna get unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you have something\Non your face! Huh? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's covered in ink! You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you guys tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been in the sky,\Nbut I haven't been in the sky.
