Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Miss Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to work so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just doing my job, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if my mother\Nand brother are home yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi wrote a phone to say he\Nwon't be in until late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your mother is waiting\Nin the dining room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good night, Miss Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, I want you\Nhere five minutes early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you were using that thing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.11,0:04:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends and I were doing\Nour homework together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you actually physically do your\Nhomework, you won't learn a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we all live so far\Naway from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more convenient\Nfor us to meet in-game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hardly qualifies as meeting\Nif you're using that toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.31,0:05:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, doing your homework\Nis not a team activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're with your friends,\Nyou'll just fool around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, you don't have time\Nto play around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're two years behind everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be studying as hard as you\Ncan to make up for all that lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am studying hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see my grades\Nfor the second semester?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left them on your desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.07,0:05:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But grades from a school like\Nthat are suspect at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your next trimester, I've\Ndecided to hire you a tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not one of those virtual\Nones everyone's going on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who'll come to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't I get to have any say in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a look at this.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.85,0:06:06.07,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fsp-1.5\frz14.83\c&H1E232C&\move(44.4,273.6,258.62,609.3,24,12203)\fax0.18}Third Year Entry Exam Guide
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.85,0:06:06.07,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fsp-1.5\frz14.83\c&H5A4073&\move(41.4,273.6,255.62,609.3,24,12203)\fax0.18}Third Year Entry Exam Guide
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.85,0:06:06.07,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fsp-1.5\frz14.83\c&H6B976C&\move(47.4,273.6,261.62,609.3,24,12203)\fax0.18}Third Year Entry Exam Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A transfer exam study guide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:06:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know someone on the\Nboard of directors there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After some discussion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I convinced them to let you take an exam\Nto transfer into their senior class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a proper high school,\Nnot some makeshift study hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since it's credit-based,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able to\Ngraduate after the first trimester.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll be back\Non track for college.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just make a\Ndecision like this without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to like the school I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The teachers there are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can learn there just\Nas much as anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to change schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done my research, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And believe me, that place you're\Nattending can hardly be called a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The curriculum is slapdash\Nand the classes are a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the faculty is substandard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a bunch of losers with\Nno real credentials to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:07:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They claim they're helping the students\Nwho fell behind because of that accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just want all the\Nchildren who've spent the last
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two years killing each other\Nin one convenient place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they can monitor them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like an asylum than a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent two years killing other kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the friends you\Nhad back in junior high
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are studying to get\Ninto college this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're leaving you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it takes an extra year or two,\Nit won't make much of a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I might not\Nwant to go to college.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.66,0:07:37.58,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\pos(474.66,406.67)\blur1.5\fsp-1.5\fscx63\fscy63\frz21.1\c&H3E353F&\fax0.16\fay0.01}Third Year Entry Exam Guide
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.66,0:07:37.58,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\pos(471.66,406.67)\blur1.5\fsp-1.5\fscx63\fscy63\frz21.1\c&H5A4073&\fax0.16\fay0.01}Third Year Entry Exam Guide
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.66,0:07:37.58,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\pos(477.66,406.67)\blur1.5\fsp-1.5\fscx63\fscy63\frz21.1\c&H6B976C&\fax0.16\fay0.01}Third Year Entry Exam Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't entertain such talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're far too gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your father and I have gone to\Ngreat lengths to nurture your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, but shouldn't I get to\Nhave a say in my own future?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.39,0:07:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I might not know what\Nkind of career I want right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm close to finding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:07:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I stay in my school for another year,\Nit will help me make that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.85,0:08:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how long you stay at a place\Nlike that, it'll just limit your options.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, try to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to make a wrong\Nturn now and regret it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to have\Na good life and find
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself a good career\Nyou can be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that boy you forced me\Nto meet on New Year's Day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that was you trying to\Nhelp me with my career?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.19,0:08:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was talking like we were\Nalready engaged or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's limiting my\Noptions, not me and not my school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marriage is part of your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you marry beneath you, or marry\Npoor, I guarantee you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't have the means to pursue\Nwhatever it is you really want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I think Yu-Yu\Nwould be an excellent choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His family owns a small regional bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are much more stable than some\Nmega-bank run by a board of directors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your last choice wasn't very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget how he made me, and\NI don't know how many others suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobuyuki Tsuko nearly bankrupted Ragout.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was your choice, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear about\Nhim in this house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my choice, it was your father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He suggested that crook\Nmarry into this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never been a good judge of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya might lack initiative,\Nbut he seems stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And stability is the\Ncornerstone of marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention to date or marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I choose who I'll marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, as long as the man you choose is\Nfrom a good family and is worthy of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, a boy like that, your little\Nfriend from school, is not worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had him investigated?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to understand, your father and I\Nonly want what's best for you in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the potential\Nto do whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as you make the right choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need time to think about transferring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, the deadline's next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, and after\Nyou fill out the form,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make three copies and leave\Nthem in my office on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though they're gone, you're still\Nashamed of Grandma and Grandpa, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're angry you weren't born\Ninto a rich, important family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.77,0:11:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, about that questionnaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you figured out\Nwhat you want to do yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess, if anything, I want to go from\Nplaying games to being a creator. A creator?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, for games?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not for games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make a human-machine interface\Nto replace the full-dive tech we use now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been going to all these tech\Nforums to learn more about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's a heck of a lot\Nof information to absorb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be with Kirito\Nand go after the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure are strong,\Nway stronger than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not strong at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that world, I was a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here, Lightning Flash Asuna of\Nthe Knights of the Blood Oath is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the real world, I\Ndon't have any real power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rare for you to be so\Npunctual, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happens sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that one day you came to my\Nplace in Selmburg and I made you dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but my memory's\Nabout as good as my punctuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember that day\Nlike it was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see that's the day\NI got a super rare food
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,item right and you made\Nan awesome stew out of it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was some tasty meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna forget that day
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't remember anything\Nexcept that stupid dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost time. I better get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna be careful with second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's like, Zekin's really\Nstrong. Just saying. Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, the others already\Ntold me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, they even told me about how you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa said in the middle of your duel\Nwith Zekken you stopped fighting to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually I asked\Na question. What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a weird vibe, so I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're full-time in this\Nworld, aren't you, Zekken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.45,0:14:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, for an answer, I got a\Nsly grin and a mega-fast attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never seen anything move that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you mean by\Nfull-time in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the same thing\Nas being a heavy user?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.99,0:14:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zekin's way different than your\Naverage everyday hardcore gamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like they were a sort of product of\Nthe full-dive environment itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, it's probably better you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best way to explain it\Nis for you to experience it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time we turn around, you're\Nalways pawing at each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your little love fest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's a duel that's\Nsupposed to be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I was on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I yield! I quit! Resign!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's 67 wins in a row!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.53,0:15:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second undefeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Liz. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked me seconds a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn! I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.67,0:15:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling! I\Nknow! Why you lost? Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't go easy on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because she's a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going full out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Halfway through our duel! Anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, is there anyone else out there\Nwant to take me on today? You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I gotta psych myself up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, once you cross swords with\Nher, believe me, you'll get psyched up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up? You next?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.35,0:16:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, does anything go\Nin this duel? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:17:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use magic or\Nitems, whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only gonna use my sword, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight on the\Nground or in the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is either okay? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's duel on the ground then.\NYou got it. Jumping's allowed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no using your wings, okay?
