Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is strong, but if I gave up now,\NI'd ruin my reputation as a Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.57,0:18:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that world, I was a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She saw my quadruple pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the Head combo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.31,0:20:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her original sword skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to lose, it might as well\Nbe to something as awesome as that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was an awesome fight, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're definitely the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't we gonna finish the duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally seen enough to\Nknow you got what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you want, we can keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for someone\Nwho could go the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.49,0:21:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.61,0:21:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, where are you going? Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.15,0:21:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I picked ya, cause you're\Nthe only one who can help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help? With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
