Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.50,0:22:30.39,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The street lights cast a glow on cheerful laughter
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.39,0:22:34.97,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k51\fad(200,200)}Ro{\k44}ji{\k41}u{\k25}ra {\k39}no {\k49}a{\k52}shi{\k23}a{\k138}to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.39,0:22:34.97,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And footprints in the back-alley
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.31,0:22:38.44,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k30\fad(200,200)}Tsu{\k26}ta{\k18}e {\k27}ta{\k34}i {\k23}o{\k39}mo{\k21}i {\k93}wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.31,0:22:38.44,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wonder how much you understood of the feelings
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.56,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k29\fad(200,200)}Do{\k20}re {\k19}da{\k20}ke {\k22}to{\k41}do{\k22}i {\k59}tan {\k24}da{\k59}rou
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.56,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've always wanted to convey to you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.56,0:22:47.44,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k39\fad(200,200)}I{\k28}tsu{\k30}mo {\k28}fu{\k43}ri {\k25}mu{\k32}i{\k21}te {\k46}ta{\k40}shi{\k38}ka{\k46}me{\k168}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.56,0:22:47.44,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I always turn around to you and make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.20,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k15\fad(200,200)}I{\k27}tsu {\k37}da{\k38}tte {\k26}ma{\k22}yo{\k19}wa{\k54}zu
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.20,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Because no matter how I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.13,0:22:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tend to be lazy about calling.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.20,0:23:02.38,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k28\fad(200,200)}Ki{\k18}mi {\k38}wa {\k43}ki{\k43}tto {\k63}don{\k19}na {\k20}bo{\k21}ku {\k26}mo {\k54}oi{\k61}ka{\k64}ke{\k161}te {\k27}ku{\k14}re{\k65}ru {\k61}ka{\k192}ra
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.20,0:23:02.38,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I believe you'd always chase after me without any hesitation
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be close to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.00,0:23:15.51,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k35\fad(200,200)}Ji{\k23}tto {\k18}mi{\k22}tsu{\k21}me{\k81}ta {\k80}ki{\k84}mi {\k74}no {\k112}hi{\k22}to{\k24}mi {\k97}ni {\k16}u{\k44}tsu{\k23}tta {\k38}bo{\k26}ku {\k56}ga {\k22}i{\k61}ki{\k17}ta {\k42}shi{\k21}ru{\k191}shi
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.00,0:23:15.51,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}When I gazed at your eyes, I saw the proof that I've lived
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.37,0:23:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see light.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.13,0:23:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never wrong. I'm never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see how many times I can hear?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.47,0:23:22.52,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k29\fad(200,200)}Na{\k15}n{\k21}do {\k20}mo {\k82}to{\k82}gi{\k74}re {\k90}sou{\k102}na {\k23}ko{\k26}do{\k38}u
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.47,0:23:22.52,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Whenever my heartbeat was about to stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.03,0:23:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see how many times I can hear?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.52,0:23:26.69,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k60\fad(200,200)}Tsu{\k22}yo{\k37}ku {\k22}tsu{\k40}yo{\k21}ku {\k41}na{\k16}ra{\k27}shi{\k130}ta
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.52,0:23:26.69,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You made it ring out very, very loudly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.98,0:23:35.03,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,0)}Kyou {\k56}wo {\k38}ko{\k25}e{\k87}te {\k40}mi{\k24}ta{\k36}in{\k396}da
